se,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b3-019-004","sourceId":"b3-019-004","sourceIndex":3,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,5],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"Rastus leads an orderly life.","start":38.29,"end":40.52,"score":0.93,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b3-019-005","sourceId":"b3-019-005","sourceIndex":4,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,16],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"He usually takes a short walk in the evenings and is always home by seven o'clock.","start":41.38,"end":46.32,"score":0.946,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b3-019-006","sourceId":"b3-019-006","sourceIndex":5,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,7],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"One evening, however he failed to arrive.","start":47.86,"end":51.06,"score":0.931,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b3-019-007","sourceId":"b3-019-007","sourceIndex":6,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,5],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"Mrs. Ramsay got very worried.","start":52.16,"end":54.28,"score":0.748,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b3-019-008","sourceId":"b3-019-008","sourceIndex":7,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,10],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"She looked everywhere for him but could not find him.","start":55.14,"end":58.24,"score":0.952,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b3-019-009","sourceId":"b3-019-009","sourceIndex":8,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,11],"wordModel":"english-ctc-fallback","text":"Three days after Rastus' disappearance, Mrs. Ramsay received an anonymous letter.","start":59.56,"end":65.21,"score":0.958,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b3-019-010","sourceId":"b3-019-010","sourceIndex":9,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,23],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"The writer stated that Rastus was in safe hands and would be returned immediately if Mrs. Ramsay paid a ransom of ￡1, 000.","start":66.1,"end":76.043,"score":0.878,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":true,"reviewReasons":["low-word-confidence"]},{"id":"b3-019-011","sourceId":"b3-019-011","sourceIndex":10,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,18],"wordModel":"english-ctc-fallback","text":"Mrs.Ramsay was instructed to place the money in a cardboard box and to leave it outside her door.","start":77.49,"end":83.68,"score":0.974,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b3-019-012-p01","sourceId":"b3-019-012","sourceIndex":11,"part":1,"parts":2,"wordRange":[0,9],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"At first, she decided to go to the police,","start":85.08,"end":87.9,"score":0.989,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b3-019-012-p02","sourceId":"b3-019-012","sourceIndex":11,"part":2,"parts":2,"wordRange":[9,27],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"but fearing that she would never see Rastus again--the letter had made that quite clear--she changed her mind.","start":88.61,"end":95.26,"score":0.972,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b3-019-013","sourceId":"b3-019-013","sourceIndex":12,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,11],"wordModel":"english-ctc-fallback","text":"She withdrew ￡1000 from her bank and followed the kidnapper's instructions.","start":96.32,"end":101.28,"score":0.988,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b3-019-014","sourceId":"b3-019-014","sourceIndex":13,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,18],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"The next morning, the box had disappeared but Mrs.Ramsay was sure that the kidnapper would keep his word.","start":102.56,"end":109.43,"score":0.964,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b3-019-015","sourceId":"b3-019-015","sourceIndex":14,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,10],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"Sure enough, Rastus arrived punctually at seven o'clock that evening.","start":110.58,"end":114.8,"score":0.896,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b3-019-016","sourceId":"b3-019-016","sourceIndex":15,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,17],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"He looked very well, though he was rather thirsty, for he drank half a bottle of milk.","start":115.92,"end":121.14,"score":0.965,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b3-019-017","sourceId":"b3-019-017","sourceIndex":16,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,13],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"The police were astounded when Mrs. Ramsay told them what she had done.","start":122.33,"end":126.14,"score":0.891,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b3-019-018","sourceId":"b3-019-018","sourceIndex":17,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,9],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"She explained that Rastus was very dear to her.","start":127.04,"end":129.7,"score":0.989,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b3-019-019","sourceId":"b3-019-019","sourceIndex":18,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,13],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"Considering the amount she paid, he was dear in more ways than one!","start":130.76,"end":135.29,"score":0.967,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]}]}
